# * stats command
# ** 1. empty file
$ hledger -f- stats
> /Accounts.* 0 \(depth 0\)/

# ** 2. included files should be listed in parse order
<
include a.j
include b.j
$  touch a.j b.j; hledger -f- stats -v; rm -f a.j b.j
> /Included files.*\/a\.j
.*\/b\.j/

# ** 3. The guessed base currency is shown as the journal's commodity symbol,
# with its ISO 4217 currency code alongside when that differs.
<
P 2026-01-01 AAPL $72

2026-01-01
    (a)    $1

$ hledger -f- stats
> /Base currency       : \$ \(USD\)/
